  "summary": "Read LINE 1/LINE 2 voltages (02h-18h), frequencies (1Ah/1Ch), the alarm word (40h) and the line, breaker and controller status words (2074h-207Ch) with function 04, subtracting one from each table address. Change mode by writing 0/1/2 to 2F00h.",
  "minimum_registers": [
