  "enable": "Fit an EXP1012 (RS-485) or EXP1013 (Ethernet) module, or use the optical port, then set menu M08 for that port: node address P08.n.01, speed .02, data format .03, stop bits .04, protocol .05 and, for Ethernet, IP address/mask/port .06-.08.",
  "watchdog": null,
  "quirks": [
